Package: optimix
Title: A Unified Contract and Auto-Selector for Efficient Optimisers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Max", "Moldovan", , "max.moldovan@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9680-8474"))
Description: Provides a single typed problem contract over a curated portfolio
    of efficient optimisers, with an automatic per-instance selector that picks
    the best optimiser for a given problem and returns it in an
    'stats::optim()'-compatible result object. The base solver runs with no
    suggested packages installed; each additional engine, and an optional
    mixture-valued mapper from 'proxymix', is loaded lazily only when used.
